      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2599644322761406751, guid: 736d416f31529b349a018fd9abd16ee4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lines.values.Array.data[222].Lines.values.Array.data[0]
      value: 10 000 cans and 10 000 batteries?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2599644322761406751, guid: 736d416f31529b349a018fd9abd16ee4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lines.values.Array.data[222].Lines.values.Array.data[1]
      value: 10 000 canette et 10 000 piles ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2599644322761406751, guid: 736d416f31529b349a018fd9abd16ee4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lines.values.Array.data[223].Lines.values.Array.data[0]
      value: I have to take a battery and a can back to Urfe. He said he'd give me
        something to deal with the pollution if I help him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2599644322761406751, guid: 736d416f31529b349a018fd9abd16ee4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lines.values.Array.data[223].Lines.values.Array.data[1]
      value: "J'dois ramener une pile et une canette \xE0 Urfe. Il a dit qu'il me
        donnait un truc contre la pollution si je l'aide."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2599644322761406751, guid: 736d416f31529b349a018fd9abd16ee4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: Lines.values.Array.data[224].Lines.values.Array.data[0]
